                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Mr.
                            Taylor.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-05-04"><hi rendition="#italic">May 4,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your No. 344 received, and we await promised further action.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Uhl</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Acting
                            Secretary.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
